      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ee55a7d03d2ae1a",
      "translationZh": "虽然我们在著名的编程基准测试中看到前沿模型得分相似，涵盖：DeepSWE、Terminal-Bench、LiveCodeBench、Code-Arena ELO。但在我看来，以下是一些真正定义深度智能和软件工程完整能力的下一代基准测试："
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efb24378c2e15ec7",
      "translationZh": "仅给定编译后的二进制文件及其文档，代理必须架构并实现一个完整的代码库，以重现原始程序的行为（无法访问反编译器或互联网）。链接：https://programbench.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5591a7d43d8d2b62",
      "translationZh": "AI代理能在没有源代码的情况下弄清楚真实世界二进制文件的功能吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a83253117dbd175",
      "translationZh": "链接：https://www.vals.ai/benchmarks/srebench"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a0489072567ef99",
      "translationZh": "当然，没有人在日常工作中阅读汇编代码，这很难。理解编译程序的能力是一种疯狂的能力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a9b2d1c6bb51fb2",
      "translationZh": "Claude Opus 5（最大）：12.5%"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6366aa9f3fbb97cb",
      "translationZh": "语言模型能否用另一种语言重新实现可工作的程序？"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d17b395e6ab27f7",
      "translationZh": "链接：https://www.vals.ai/benchmarks/code-migration"
    },
